# Signing keys for release builds. Never committed: anyone holding one can publish an
# update that Android will install over the app without warning. Back them up somewhere
# safe — losing a key means no future release can update an existing install in place,
# and on Accrescent it means the listing cannot be updated at all.
*.jks
keystore.properties
